olid #f5f5f5\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>      \r\n<tr><td height=\"20\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ol-adpad\" style=\"padding: 20px 3.5% 0 3.5%;\"><p class=\"b\"\r\nstyle=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100% !important; margin-bottom: 0 !important; font-size: 11px !important; letter-spacing: 1.4px; color: #008dc8; font-weight:700;\"\r\n>\r\nA MESSAGE FROM AMERICA’S CREDIT UNIONS\r\n</p></td></tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"padding: 20px 3.5%; line-height: 1.5;\"><span class=\"b k\" style=\"font-size: 26px; color: #222222;  font-family: 'gorditamedium', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;  letter-spacing: -0.1px; line-height: 1.5;\">Credit unions: a century of stability</span></td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"10\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n<a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47480543.\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://tpc.googlesyndication.com/pageadimg/imgad?id=CICAgJCV3eu4_QEQARgBKAEyCCM6u1ufYn7y\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" style=\"width:100%\" /></a>\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"15\" style=\"height: 15px; font-size: 0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td class=\"v\" style=\"padding: 0 3.5%; line-height: 1.75;  font-size: 17px; font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 1.75; color: #222222; letter-spacing: -0.1px;\">\r\n<p><strong>Once helped our nation rise.</strong> Now, they help it thrive.</p>\r\n<p>From helping America recover from the Great Depression to now contributing $352 billion to the economy and employing over one million Americans, credit unions have supported our people and our country through good times and hard times alike.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47480543.\" target=\"_blank\">Learn more.</a>\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"10\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0; border-bottom: 10px solid #f5f5f5;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 10px;line-height:1.5\"